# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 03f140fb3ed97157f3f45f3626724bce234733e0493058bac068d9b7f093b112
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 6ebc6282dcac0cb1f6126b9c0a61c8e4e4c529893af2012d1b1b1e82be487dc9
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 3ec26b0943cc175c0a060b52b3a068c14c25c3712b733faa4e2347d239057552
